	(text "TUBE DRIVERS: 3 x HV5622 (220 V open drain)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 22.86 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a86c8af4-b9ed-5a0e-a3df-0533bc502aaf"))
	(text "Tube 1 at the left as seen by the viewer. Chain U201 -> U202 -> U203 (DRV12_D1, DRV12_D2), 96 bits latched whole (LE); U203 DOUT back to the RP2040 (DRV12_DOUT, readback). Outputs assigned from the PCB geometry (HV_MAP in\ntools/gen_nixie_schematics.py, table in docs/hardware.md); HVOUT1-5 and 30-32 spare. Firmware owns the map. Each tube: 12k anode resistor from NIX_HV, 150k in series with each decimal point." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 24.13 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "fb5b97c1-4445-51a2-8a61-c865f046d2ab"))
	(text "U201: TUBES 1 AND 2" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 48.26 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "43c87283-b45a-5251-bb90-4c4017ac592c"))
